# Internal working notes, kept out of the repository. This one records that the
# published client quotes were drafted rather than quoted from a message, which
# is not something to put on a public remote. The file stays on disk locally.
# Leading slash: root only. A bare "content/" would also match src/content/,
# which holds the legal page collection the build needs.
/content/

